# Keeps `gcloud run deploy --source .` from uploading 14 MB of virtualenv and
# the generated reports on every deploy. Only the package is copied into the
# image (see Dockerfile), but everything not listed here is still uploaded to
# Cloud Build first.
.git/
.venv/
.claude/
out/
tests/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
deploy/
*.md
